        "Content": "<ul><li>Stunningly appointed three-bedroom mid-terraced home</li><li>Ideally positioned in a highly private and quiet enclave</li><li>Presented in walk-in condition</li><li>Highly Efficient A2 Energy Rating</li><li>Lovely views out towards Drummin Trees</li><li>Light-filled interiors</li><li>Off-street parking </li><li>Reputable Wood Group builders</li><li>GFCH</ul>"
